## Overview

As the founding designer at GameVee (later acquired by GotGame), I shipped two major iterations of a social network for sharing gameplay videos.

- Defined its visual language, including the logo and the Ludus mascot.
- Improved the video upload experience to reduce repetitive actions.
- Iterated on how users interact with each other.
